    "Anderson2017 TableS1 explicitly reports MgO<0.01wt% by independent ActLabs FUS-ICP for three salt endmember records; Fe2O3(T) has no censored value anywhere in that table.",
    "Na2SO4 Batch2/Mix11O is a potentially useful new Mg source-assay control lead. No lot certificate, exact acquisition session or complete licensed numerical manifest was established; it is not admitted.",
    "Cousin2011 reports >99.98% purity and explicit vacuum calibration for pure targets, but predominantly uses a different Toulouse EQM/OceanOptics setup; impurity certification, numerical export and matched identities remain unresolved.",
    "ChemCam release42/41 dated2026-08-03 adds mission observations without updated product types. Its calibration chemistry file is byte-identical to the previously reviewed file.",
    "ChemCam CCCT Ti is Ti6Al4V rather than an assumed pure-Ti blank; graphite has reported surface impurities including Fe. Neither establishes qualified Fe/Mg bounds."
  ],
